    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Trust Deed for a Self Managed Superannuation Fund ",
            "block_bbox": [
                289,
                81,
                884,
                114
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Members can only contribute the types of assets authorised by this Trust Deed (as detailed under \"Investments\" below).\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                209,
                167,
                1052,
                232
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c.  Contributions can be from the Member, the Member's employer or Member's government co-contribution, and can be concessional or nonconcessional.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                213,
                267,
                1048,
                357
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. The Fund can also receive transfers on from a Member's existing superannuation fund.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                217,
                395,
                973,
                453
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "13. Member Benefit Accounts:",
            "block_bbox": [
                141,
                544,
                492,
                569
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Each Member must have a separately identifiable accumulation account or pension account.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                220,
                636,
                1070,
                689
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. The administrative and other costs of running the Fund will be split equally between the Members of the Fund, calculated pro rata to their total assets in the Fund, as at the year end (being 30th June each year). In the event that any Member joins or leaves the Fund during the financial year,that Member will pay a pro rata share of administrative costs.",
            "block_bbox": [
                220,
                723,
                1073,
                863
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. Tax will be calculated on behalf of each Member and applied directly to the Member account balance.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                218,
                896,
                1050,
                947
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. The Trustee may set out an equalisation amount to allow for a Reserving Strategy or to accrue for Expenses or Tax.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                217,
                982,
                1057,
                1035
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. A Contribution Reserve Account may be created at the discretion of the Trustees.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                217,
                1069,
                1046,
                1122
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "14. Member Investments ",
            "block_bbox": [
                144,
                1215,
                424,
                1236
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Authorised investments of the Fund are set out in the Investment Strategy and include the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
                140,
                1299,
                1076,
                1351
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Shares and related investments including options, futures and CFD's;",
            "block_bbox": [
                219,
                1384,
                1020,
                1411
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b.  Separately Managed Accounts, Managed Investments and Unit Trusts;",
            "block_bbox": [
                219,
                1440,
                1033,
                1471
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 13
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c.Foreign exchange, gold and silver;",
            "block_bbox": [
                220,
                1497,
                632,
                1527
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 14
        },
        {
            "block_label": "number",
            "block_content": "6",
            "block_bbox": [
                572,
                1607,
                585,
                1625
            ],
            "block_id": 15,
            "block_order": null
        }
    ],
